  "description": "Generate BMFont-compatible bitmap font atlases from TTF/OTF/WOFF/WOFF2 files. Reads and writes BMFont .bmfc and Hiero .hiero (libGDX) configuration formats. Features layered effects (outline, fill color, gradient, shadow), shared-atlas shadow silhouette variants, gamma correction, selectable hint levels, fractional per-glyph metrics, per-glyph advance adjustment, color font support (COLRv0/CPAL, sbix, CBDT), symbol fonts (Wingdings, Webdings, Symbol), variable fonts, SDF rendering, LCD subpixel anti-aliasing, font subsetting, channel packing, super sampling, TGA/DDS/PNG output, and extended metadata. In-memory pipeline with text/XML/binary .fnt output. Includes bitmap post-processors (bold, italic). Adds glyphs incrementally to an existing atlas, generates from system-installed fonts by family name, batch-generates multiple fonts in parallel, accepts custom glyph images, and reads existing .fnt files (text/XML/binary). Supports pluggable rasterizer backends (FreeType, GDI, DirectWrite, and StbTrueType available as separate packages). Hardened font parsing: core's parser rejects malformed fonts with an exception instead of hanging or crashing.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
